.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-delete - Delete a container environment (prepaid)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container delete  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a container environment (prepaid)

.PP
Same as the panel's Spending > Delete: hourly charges stop at once and the environment is deleted right away with every service, node, registry image, pipeline and custom domain binding (no retention period). Needs \fB"confirm": true\fR (body or query) and an \fBIdempotency-Key\fR header; repeating returns 202 \fBdeleted\fR\&. Environments billed by invoice answer 409 \fBnot_prepaid\fR\&. Terraform: destroying \fBgyro_container_environment\fR calls this.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/containers/{id} (operationId deleteContainerEnvironment, scope cloud_delete)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
